!!! warning
# Important Safety Notice

By using XCSoar, you acknowledge and accept the following:

## Limitations

- XCSoar is for **situational awareness only**
- XCSoar is **not** a FLARM display
- XCSoar is **not** aviation certified in any way
- The artificial horizon is **not** fit for any purpose
- Databanks (airspace, waypoints) may contain errors, be incomplete, or **not** up to date
- NOTAM display does **not** replace proper pre-flight NOTAM briefing
- NOTAM data may be incomplete, delayed, filtered, or unavailable
- XCSoar is **not** guaranteed to be error free

## Pilot Responsibility

The **Pilot in Command** is always responsible for the safe operation of the aircraft. Never rely solely on XCSoar for navigation or situational awareness.

␀␀[Full GPL License](xcsoar://dialog/credits)␀## No Warranty (GPL Section 11)

BECAUSE THE PROGRAM IS LICENSED FREE OF CHARGE, THERE IS NO WARRANTY FOR THE PROGRAM, TO THE EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW. EXCEPT WHEN OTHERWISE STATED IN WRITING THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS AND/OR OTHER PARTIES PROVIDE THE PROGRAM "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESSED OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, THE IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. THE ENTIRE RISK AS TO THE QUALITY AND PERFORMANCE OF THE PROGRAM IS WITH YOU. SHOULD THE PROGRAM PROVE DEFECTIVE, YOU ASSUME THE COST OF ALL NECESSARY SERVICING, REPAIR OR CORRECTION.

␀␀␀␀%s%s%s␀␀I have read and understand the above disclaimer␀Safety Disclaimer␀␀␀Don't show these release notes again␀␀␀␀What's New␀␀Don't show this guide again␀Gesture Navigation␀␀Getting Started␀Preflight␀␀␀After Your Flight␀␀␀Done␀␀␀␀LastSeenNewsVersion␀DisclaimerAcknowledgedVersion␀␀␀HideQuickGuideDialogOnStartup␀␀␀EnableThermalInformationMap␀WeGlideEnabled␀␀# Gesture Navigation

XCSoar supports touch gestures on the map:

- ![U](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UP) **Swipe Up** (U): Zoom in
- ![D](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DOWN) **Swipe Down** (D): Zoom out
- ![R](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RIGHT) **Swipe Right** (R): Previous screen mode
- ![L](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LEFT) **Swipe Left** (L): Next screen mode
- ![UD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UD) **Up-Down** (UD): Auto zoom
- ![DU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DU) **Down-Up** (DU): Menu
- ![DR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DR) **Down-Right** (DR): Waypoint details
- ![DL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DL) **Down-Left** (DL): Alternates
- ![LU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LU) **Left-Up** (LU): Recently used waypoints
- ![RD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RD) **Right-Down** (RD): Task manager
- ![URD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URD) **Up-Right-Down** (URD): Analysis
- ![LDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDR) **Left-Down-Right** (LDR): Checklist
- ![URDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URDL) **Up-Right-Down-Left** (URDL): Pan mode
- ![LDRDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDRDL) **Left-Down-Right-Down-Left** (LDRDL): Status
- ![ULDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_ULDR) **Up-Left-Down-Right** (ULDR): Quick menu

Long-press on the map to enter Pan mode. Tap while in Pan mode to see nearby waypoints.␀Gesture Help␀␀␀␀Usage: %s %s
