## glide computer

- remember water ballast, crew weight, and bugs when XCSoar is restarted during a flight. Startup asks before restoring and restores after 5 seconds; No keeps the logger crew template and empty ballast [#1019](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/issues/1019)
- remember QNH and the maximum forecast temperature with that same question

## ui

- show whether the aircraft is in flight on the Status Times page
- remember the ATC radial and the current Goto when an unfinished flight is restored; loading or resuming an ordered task clears the Goto, and the automatic takeoff Goto is not kept [#2795](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/issues/2795)

## map

- show own-ship, Cloud, SkyLines, and Thermal Information Map thermals as one marker. A tap shows the source, position, lift and age, and can start a Go To. Markers within a kilometre keep the newer one [#3093](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/issues/3093)
- draw own-ship, Cloud, and SkyLines wave lines from one list [#3094](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/issues/3094)

## android

- add Share to Export flights so selected IGC/NMEA files can be sent via the system share sheet (Nearby Share, Drive, mail, â€¦)
- show the Export flights Share button as the Android share mark
- fix a map crash on PowerVR Rogue tablets while panning with topography enabled [#1235](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/issues/1235)
- keep menu, dialogue and status text from overflowing on a high-resolution phone [#3375](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/issues/3375)

## dialogs

- remember checklist checkbox ticks when an unfinished flight is restored; choosing a different checklist file, or editing a page's text, clears the ticks for that file or page [#2536](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/issues/2536)
- apply Configuration changes without restarting XCSoar. This covers Warning time, Acknowledge time, Text size, Display resolution, GR average period, Events, and Log book [#3392](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/issues/3392)
- fix a crash opening Pages setup from a weather overlay on a landscape screen [#3373](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/issues/3373)

## documentation

- document the unfinished-flight question for ballast, crew weight, bugs, QNH, the maximum forecast temperature, the ATC radial, Goto, and checklist ticks
- describe the size limit for menu, dialogue and status text
- describe shared thermal markers, their details, and Go To

## data

- add an option on Site files to download newer copies of files already on the device when XCSoar starts. The progress bar shows the download, and a message reports when files were updated. A download that finishes in flight is loaded at the next start [#417](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/issues/417)
- load a File Manager update of a file selected in Site files without restarting. This covers the map, waypoints, airspace, RASP, FLARMNet, the checklist, and the input file [#1115](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/issues/1115) [#3092](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/issues/3092)

## airspace

- show when an OpenAir airspace is active from its activation times [#2520](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/issues/2520)
- fix Ack Day on a lower sector also silencing the airspace above its ceiling
- fix Ack Day silencing a new airspace after the airspace list was empty

## task

- scan task QR codes with the camera on iOS, like on Android

## development

- document which reload runs when a map zip finishes loading and when File Manager updates a configured file [#3095](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/issues/3095)
